            "title": "科技｜Leica錘紋漆相機復刻 數碼版叫價8.6萬",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"科技｜Leica錘紋漆相機復刻 數碼版叫價8.6萬\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/83bc79fd5cdbef83646918fcc4efd6ba99c615e7b46d5eba940632a73974024e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">科技｜Leica錘紋漆相機復刻 數碼版叫價8.6萬</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Leica推出兩款Hammertone錘紋漆特別版相機，重現1964年僅約10部MD相機使用的工藝，每部機身紋理略有不同。M11-P數碼版香港售86,000港元，配6,000萬像素全片幅感光元件及256GB儲存。M-A菲林版售62,000港元，採純機械操作。</p></div>",
